name: The Serpent — draw 3 cards
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Serpent always draws 3 cards after play or discard (ignores hand size). Ante 5 boss:
  need hand-size management or Luchador/Chicot.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: TheSerpent
    antes: [5]
should:
  - joker: Luchador
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Chicot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Juggler
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
